<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (This project develops a smart organ donation matching system that uses Artificial Intelligence search algorithms to identify optimal donor-recipient pairs. The system begins by collecting data related to donors and recipients, including blood group, organ type, urgency level, and geographical location. This data is used to construct a structured state space where each state represents a possible donor-recipient pair. The system then applies constraint checking to eliminate invalid matches and uses search algorithms to explore valid states. A cost function evaluates each state based on multiple factors, while a heuristic function estimates the best possible path to an optimal solution. The final output of the system is the most suitable donor- recipient match based on minimum cost and maximum compatibility. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
